			"hadithnumber": 87,
			"arabicnumber": 87,
			"text": "Madan bin Abi Talhah narrated from Abu Ad-Darda that :\"Allah's Messenger vomited [so he broke fast] so he performed Wudu.\" So I met Thawban in a Masjid in Damascus, and I mentioned that to him. He said: 'He told the truth, I poured the water for his Wudu",
